# Cloudflare Workers Assets / Pages redirects file.
# Format: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# The blog moved to roydipta.com/blog/. This deployment now exists only to 301
# the old URLs there, so link equity and bookmarks survive the move.
#
# Three things that matter here, learned the hard way about site moves:
#
#   1. 301, not 302. Only a permanent redirect passes ranking signals.
#   2. Each URL maps to its OWN counterpart. A blanket redirect to the new
#      homepage is treated as a soft 404 and throws away the signal entirely,
#      which would defeat the point of doing this at all.
#   3. This deployment must STAY UP. It is the thing serving the redirects.
#      Keep it for at least a year; it is free, so really just keep it.
#
# Matching is case-sensitive, and three of the old URLs carry capitals, so the
# lowercase variants are listed too. Inbound links and shares get case-mangled.

